---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/retail.css';
---
<Base
  title="Terms of Use &mdash; Airborne Dent Repair"
  description="Terms for using the Airborne Dent Repair website, including what an estimate request is and is not."
  nav="Terms" css="retail">
<main>

<section class="hero hero-short" id="top">
  <div class="hero-panel">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="display h-xl rv rv-d1">Terms Of Use.</h1>
    <p class="lede rv rv-d2">The terms for using this website. The terms of the repair itself are on your estimate and work order, not here.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap legal-doc">
    <p class="w3f-hint rv"><strong>Last updated:</strong> September 2026 &middot; Airborne Dent Repair, 489 Reed Ln, Unit 2, Gunter, TX 75058</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">Who this is</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">This site is operated by Airborne Dent Repair, a paintless dent repair, hail, windshield and window tint shop in Gunter, Texas. Using the site means you accept what is on this page.</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">An estimate request is not a booking</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">Sending a form does not book work, reserve a slot, hold a loaner, or create a contract. It starts a conversation. We will come back to you, and any actual price, schedule and scope is agreed in writing on an estimate or work order after we have seen the vehicle.</p>
    <p class="prose rv">Anything we say before we have seen the vehicle is a rough indication. Hail damage in particular cannot be quoted accurately from a description or a photograph.</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">Accuracy of what is on this site</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">We write this site carefully and keep it current, but we do not promise it is free of errors or that every detail is up to date at the moment you read it. Service descriptions, capacity, coverage areas and turnaround are general and may change. Where something on this site conflicts with your written estimate or work order, the estimate or work order is what counts.</p>
    <p class="prose rv">Photographs on this site are of work carried out by this shop. They show what we have done, not what your vehicle will look like &mdash; results depend on the panel, the paint and the damage.</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">Warranty</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">Paintless dent repair carried out by us carries a lifetime warranty. Window tint carries the film manufacturer's warranty, not ours. The terms, and what falls outside them, are set out on your paperwork. Nothing on this page adds to or takes away from that.</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">Insurance</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">We document damage, speak to your adjuster and manage the file where you ask us to. We do not decide your claim, and we cannot promise any particular outcome, coverage decision or payment from your insurer. Your policy is between you and your carrier.</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">Using the site</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">Please do not use the forms to send spam, to send anything unlawful, or to try to break, overload or probe the site. Do not submit anyone else's personal information without their say-so.</p>
    <p class="prose rv">The text, photographs, logo and design on this site belong to Airborne Dent Repair. Please do not republish them as your own.</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">Links to other sites</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">Where we link somewhere else, we are not responsible for what is on the other end of the link.</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">Availability</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">We do not guarantee the site is available without interruption. Forms depend on a third-party service and on your connection. <strong>If a form fails, call <a href="tel:+16822260543">682-226-0543</a> &mdash; do not assume a message reached us unless you saw it confirmed on screen.</strong></p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">Governing law</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Texas.</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">Contact</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">Airborne Dent Repair &middot; 489 Reed Ln, Unit 2, Gunter, TX 75058<br />
      <a href="tel:+16822260543">682-226-0543</a> &middot; <a href="mailto:airbornepdr@gmail.com">airbornepdr@gmail.com</a></p>

    <p class="prose rv" style="margin-top:2rem"><a href="/privacy">Privacy policy &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

</main>
</Base>
